BT /F1 10 Tf 13 TL 50 800 Td (Travel and expense policy) Tj T* (Applies to all employees from 1 April 2026.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Booking) Tj T* (Book all flights, trains and hotels through the travel desk portal. Bookings made elsewhere) Tj T* (are reimbursed only if they were cheaper than the portal price on the same day.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Limits per night for hotels) Tj T* (Mumbai, Delhi, Bengaluru: up to INR 9,000) Tj T* (Other Indian cities: up to INR 6,000) Tj T* (International: the city limit listed in the travel desk portal) Tj T* () Tj T* (Flights) Tj T* (Economy class for all flights under 6 hours. Premium economy for longer flights. Business) Tj T* (class needs approval from a director.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Meals) Tj T* (Up to INR 1,500 per day in India without receipts. Above that, receipts are required.) Tj T* (Alcohol is not reimbursed.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Equipment and IT purchases) Tj T* (IT equipment \(laptops, monitors, headsets, software\) is never bought on expenses. Order it) Tj T* (through the service portal so IT can register, secure and support it. Expensed IT purchases) Tj T* (are rejected.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Claims) Tj T* (Submit claims in the expense tool within 30 days of the trip. The expense tool uses single) Tj T* (sign-on; if it shows an SSO error, see the IT status page. Claims are paid with the next) Tj T* (salary run after approval by your manager.) Tj T* ET
